		{
			description: [
				"Backpacks upgrade through iron, gold and diamond tiers while retaining contents. Empty a pack before experimenting if you are unsure."
				"Sophisticated Backpacks upgrades the same inventory through material tiers. Give each pack a role, open its upgrade tabs deliberately, and configure filters before enabling automatic pickup, magnet, refill, or void behaviour."
				"Pickup and filter upgrades can match individual items, existing contents, tags, or whole mods depending on tier. Test with harmless blocks so a broad rule does not steal building supplies or destroy a rare drop."
				"Storage should have layers: backpack for the road, drawers for bulk, ordinary labelled containers for unique objects, and a searchable terminal across the room. One giant unsorted network only hides disorder behind a search bar."
			]
