			title: "Storage Lab: The Tom's Network Core"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2D0F242D77ABDD04"]
			description: [
				"Build a locked drawer bank for stone, wood, crops, ingots, and other repeated materials. A Controller provides one inventory face for the entire connected bank, making it a clean bridge to Tom's Storage or Create."
				"Use the Drawer Key before an empty drawer is exposed to automation. Capacity upgrades multiply storage, while Compacting Drawers expose valid material forms from one shared quantity."
				"Connect the controller through one deliberate path and test deposits plus extraction. Unique tools and data-bearing items should remain in labelled chests rather than being forced into a system designed for repetition."
			]
			id: "4130E2674DF6828B"
			rewards: [{
				id: "454DAD58DEEB41D5"
