			title: "Storage Lab: Drawers Behind the Terminal"
			x: 8.0d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4130E2674DF6828B"]
			description: [
				"Storage Drawers are ideal for one material in large quantities. Right-click to insert, left-click to extract, and use a double-click to deposit matching items."
				"Storage Drawers are for repeated materials, not unique treasures. Lock a drawer's assignment before automation touches it, then add capacity only when real volume proves the upgrade is needed."
				"Compacting Drawers share one quantity across valid nugget, ingot, and block forms. Check JEI for reversible conversions first; not every modded material should be trusted to compact automatically."
				"A Drawer Controller exposes the connected drawer bank as one inventory to hoppers, pipes, Create, or Tom's Storage. Keep the controller accessible and avoid connecting the same storage through several competing paths."
			]
			id: "145EE14BCE66ADC0"
